* An immediate PC-relative to an external (movea.l #Ext-*-(fin-lab+2),a2: a symbol the linker
* defines, its distance from the instruction): both r68s write a PC-relative reference on the
* immediate (R_68K_PC32, PC16 for .w), its addend 2 plus the rest of the expression; as refused
* an external less * ("invalid operands"). Written with 0 there and .reloc; move.l stays move.l.
* fixed: d699c42 2026-10-13 r68togas: corner cases; align and index forms as Ultra C's r68; -m1 pads to 2
* expect text: 4e71 247c00000000 b5fc00000000 203c00000000 323c0000 4e71 4e71
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC32        Ext-0x00000018
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC32        Btx-0x00000018
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC32        Ext+0x00000002
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC16        Ext+0x00000008
 psect pc_immediate_ext,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
lab movea.l #Ext-*-(fin-lab+2),a2
 cmpa.l #Btx-*-(fin-lab+2),a2
 move.l #Ext-*,d0
 move.w #Ext-*+6,d1
 nop
fin nop
 ends
